{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIME TO PICK UP YOUR BOWS AND 1 ARROW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, maybe if it weren't for the circumstances in which you find yourselves, these challenges are easy to solve, but now you have to rely on each other because of the curse of the Sorcerer who took away your most valuable possessions! Your arrows! Now you have to share 1 cursed arrow for you 2...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/e2c6d6a616e015a57d0a4bf6112ef756.poster.webp?t=1753365220\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/e2c6d6a616e015a57d0a4bf6112ef756.webp?t=1753365220\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>THE GAME IS FOR 2 PLAYERS ONLY!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't play 1 or if there are 3 or more of you, you can play 4, but if you split into 2 pairs, you get the idea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS GAME ABOUT ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Bows 1 Arrow is a \u0441oop action puzzle platforming about your adventure with unique shooting mechanic that allows each player to shoot in queue ONLY after each other. To make things worse the Sorcerer build castel as a maze of archery challenges, platforms and deadly minions, all that would be much more simplier if you only had more than 1 arrow...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT\u00a0CHALLENGES?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We offer you (for now):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Picture description puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting the Sorcerer's minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-operative 3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss battle</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825740?t=1753365220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825740?t=1753365220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/104ced2c0f3542529685f14777b490a8660e7bb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753365220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/104ced2c0f3542529685f14777b490a8660e7bb5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753365220","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3841920,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TIME TO PICK UP YOUR BOWS AND 1 ARROW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Well, maybe if it weren't for the circumstances in which you find yourselves, these challenges are easy to solve, but now you have to rely on each other because of the curse of the Sorcerer who took away your most valuable possessions! Your arrows! Now you have to share 1 cursed arrow for you 2...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/e2c6d6a616e015a57d0a4bf6112ef756.poster.webp?t=1753365220\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/e2c6d6a616e015a57d0a4bf6112ef756.webp?t=1753365220\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>THE GAME IS FOR 2 PLAYERS ONLY!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can't play 1 or if there are 3 or more of you, you can play 4, but if you split into 2 pairs, you get the idea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WHAT IS GAME ABOUT ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 Bows 1 Arrow is a \u0441oop action puzzle platforming about your adventure with unique shooting mechanic that allows each player to shoot in queue ONLY after each other. To make things worse the Sorcerer build castel as a maze of archery challenges, platforms and deadly minions, all that would be much more simplier if you only had more than 1 arrow...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHAT\u00a0CHALLENGES?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We offer you (for now):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Picture description puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fighting the Sorcerer's minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-operative 3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Boss battle</p></li></ul>","developers":["SKL Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/c121497d18bfe1446f1c0bc0db3f91cd58823869/header.jpg?t=1753365220","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163343,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163343/movie480.mp4?t=1751907881","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163343/movie_max.mp4?t=1751907881"},"name":"First look","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset